Recommends: firmware-linux, firmware-misc-nonfree, firmware-realtek, firmware-atheros, firmware-iwlwifi, mesa-vulkan-drivers, vulkan-tools, btrfs-progs, snapper, fonts-noto-core, fonts-noto-ui-core, fonts-noto-mono, fonts-noto-cjk, fonts-noto-color-emoji, xdg-desktop-portal-gnome, apt-listchanges, fwupd, gnome-software-plugin-fwupd | gnome-software, low-memory-monitor
Installed-Size: 4
Description: Tind desktop: lean GNOME, Flatpak, printing, firewall, safe updates
 Metapackage that names the GNOME pieces explicitly (instead of gnome-core) so
 unwanted apps stay off the system. GNOME with
 the persistent dock, GNOME Software with Flatpak, printing, Bluetooth, a
 default-deny firewall, unattended security updates, non-free firmware and
 the Mesa Vulkan stack. Packages in Recommends are installed by default but
 will not break the build if one is renamed in Debian.
